I came, unfortunately, to how I met your mother with all life of my life events have been used already.
不幸的是，等我来到《老爸老妈浪漫史》时，我生活中的所有经历都已经用光了。

00:16:50.299 --> 00:17:28.400
beautifully caught up to that to real-time such a it was that the thing we were saying was true which is that was the ultimate education in how to write a really good solid classic sitcom you know the beats go like this you hit this at the act break you hit this and you get the and you know everything which I didn't really even know at that point and really learned it all there and so to be able to then go to how I met your mother like I don't think I wouldn't say that I was hugely effective on that show, but I wouldn't have been effective if I didn't first know all the rules that we were kind of breaking.
（笑）这非常完美地契合了现实，我们所说的是真的，那就是关于如何写出一部真正优秀、扎实、经典的室内情景喜剧，这里是终极课堂，你知道的，剧情节奏是这样的：在广告幕间要打出这个点，你要击中这个点，然后就会有……你懂所有的套路，虽然我当时甚至还不太懂，但我在那儿真正把这一切都学会了。所以后来能够去到《老友记》……哦不，去到《老爸老妈浪漫史》——我觉得我在那部剧里并没有起到多么巨大的作用，但如果我没有先掌握我们要打破的那些规则，我也不会发挥出什么作用。

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:29.240
Right, yeah, yeah.
对，没错，没错。

